From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Sat, 17 May 2026 21:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ggml-cuda: skip unity build for files with name collisions

Exclude conv2d.cu and conv2d-dw.cu from CMake unity builds due to
duplicate struct definitions (conv_params, kernel_bounds, whcn_layout)
and non-static __device__ functions with different signatures.

Also exclude argsort.cu, mean.cu, sum.cu, and ssm-scan.cu which use
"using namespace cub;" at file scope, risking ambiguity when combined
with other translation units.
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/CMakeLists.txt | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/CMakeLists.txt b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/CMakeLists.txt
index 67af1d8..9412990 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -71,6 +71,9 @@ if (CUDAToolkit_FOUND)
                              ${GGML_SOURCES_CUDA}
                             )

+    set_source_files_properties(conv2d.cu conv2d-dw.cu argsort.cu mean.cu sum.cu ssm-scan.cu
+                               PROPERTIES SKIP_UNITY_BUILD_INCLUSION ON)
+
     add_compile_definitions(GGML_CUDA_PEER_MAX_BATCH_SIZE=${GGML_CUDA_PEER_MAX_BATCH_SIZE})

     if (GGML_CUDA_GRAPHS)
